# Bulk regression case (assistant-written): a `match` arm whose *pattern* is
# not a pattern, followed by an indented body. This shape made `heroes parse`
# loop forever until 2026-08-04 (panel 014's costing found it).
function f(k: i64) -> i64
    return match k
        + => 1  #~ expected_pattern
            print(k)
        _ => 0
